+Xirang local fork of picomatch 4.0.7 (MIT).
+Upstream: https://registry.npmjs.org/picomatch/-/picomatch-4.0.7.tgz
+Integrity: sha512-qcJu88Q2IWqJsDD529JKMdwGm/dvInW4HvQnRwiH9JtihJvzGOscDtHE3x1pBKeUOTysQ8kVmLnJ2kJu7yhcGA==
+Original copyright and MIT license are retained. This is locally maintained,
+not an official patched picomatch release. Addresses GHSA-fc5q-39xc-vjpf
+with token reductions and an emitted-regex guard.
+Nested repeated wildcard structures can be treated literally, including
+capture/default extglob forms. The guard is structural, not a general
+regex complexity guarantee; raw regex and manually modified states remain raw.
